+# Version Scheme
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to version releases with Semantic Versioning (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH), chosen because it tells users directly what to expect when they update: a major version bump signals breaking changes, a minor bump signals backward-compatible additions, and a patch bump signals bug fixes.
